1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,325
And never double the connective, the commonest Nepali influenced error.

2
00:00:05,325 --> 00:00:07,343
Although with but: keep one.

3
00:00:07,343 --> 00:00:09,778
Because with so: keep one.

4
00:00:09,778 --> 00:00:12,513
No sooner with then: it must be than.

5
00:00:12,513 --> 00:00:16,510
Unless already means if not, so never unless you don't.

6
00:00:16,510 --> 00:00:19,765
Lest is already negative, so never lest you should not.

7
00:00:19,765 --> 00:00:21,783
And despite never takes of.

